DESCRIPTION:Last year Michael Palascak appeared on Nateland Presents: The S
 howcase on YouTube. Michael also released his self-produced special He's Fr
 iendly  which has garnered over 215\, 000 views on YouTube and has multipl
 e tracks streaming on Sirius XM’s comedy channels like Pure Comedy. You c
 an also find him on Paramount + where his debut half hour is streaming on S
 eason 1\, Episode 2 of Comedy Central’s The Half Hour and on CBS on an up
 coming episode of Comics Unleashed. Michael grew up in a small town in Indi
 ana and began doing stand-up in Chicago after his parents moved the family
  to the suburbs during his formative years. Drew Hunt of The Chicago Reader
  writes about Michael’s stand-up\, “In a lot of ways\, he represents th
 e ideal antidote to the sort of unbridled cynicism that pervades much of co
 ntemporary stand-up.” The Guardian writes\, “In stand up\, there is the
  writing\, and then there is the performing. This guy nails both… clean\,
  clever\, dark and\, most importantly\, funny.” As a clean comedian\, he 
 has racked up multiple late night credits with appearances on The Tonight S
 how\, The Late Show\, The Late Late Show\, and Conan. Additionally\, he was
  a Top 5 Finalist on the last season of Last Comic Standing after eliminati
 ng Taylor Tomlinson in a head-to-head stand-up competition where one judge 
 claimed\, “My first impression of Michael was a great likability. This is
  a guy that could star in a sitcom.” Michael currently resides in Califor
 nia and is a dad. Every Monday night he records a podcast after his kid goe
 s to sleep. It is called I Just Got My Kid To Sleep .\n\nAges 18+\nFee appl
 ies if transferring confirmed ticket purchase to another guest.\nDoors for 
 open for seating approximately 30 minutes before late showtimes. Please not
 e\, doors are subject to prior show endtime and may change without notice\,
